---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Amplivate collects, uses, and protects your data.">
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: [date]</p>

      <p class="legal__notice">
        This is a draft policy structure, not a substitute for legal advice. Please have it
        reviewed by a solicitor before launch, and fill in the bracketed details below.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Amplivate ("we", "us", "our") is a digital marketing agency operating UK-wide. This
        policy explains what personal data we collect through this website, why, and what
        rights you have over it. Our contact email is
        <a href="mailto:hello@amplivate.co.uk">hello@amplivate.co.uk</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Information you submit through our contact form: name, email address, business name, and message content.</li>
        <li>Basic technical data collected automatically, such as pages visited, if analytics are enabled.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
      <p>
        We use contact form submissions to respond to enquiries and provide quotes or
        strategy calls. We do not sell your data to third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Legal basis</h2>
      <p>
        We process contact form data on the basis of legitimate interest (responding to a
        direct enquiry you've made) under UK GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>[State retention period — e.g. contact form submissions are kept for X months.]</p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Contact form submissions are processed via
        [name the form-handling service once one is in place]. We do not share your data
        beyond what's needed to respond to your enquiry.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not set any cookies. We use your browser's local storage to remember
        that you've dismissed our cookie notice, which stays on your device and is never sent
        to us. We do not use analytics, advertising, or tracking cookies at this time. If that
        changes, this policy will be updated to reflect it.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under UK GDPR, you have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your
        personal data. To exercise these rights, contact
        <a href="mailto:hello@amplivate.co.uk">hello@amplivate.co.uk</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 6rem) var(--section-padding);
  }

  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-2xl);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal__updated {
    color: var(--color-slate-blue);
    font-size: var(--step-sm);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal__notice {
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: var(--step-sm);
    color: var(--color-slate-blue);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-lg);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    color: var(--color-slate-blue);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal a {
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
  }
</style>
